  "info": {
    "description": "Stable contract for the Hermes Calendar dashboard plugin routes. All /api/* routes use the Hermes dashboard authentication (X-Hermes-Session-Token or Bearer in token mode, session cookie in password-protected mode); the plugin never sees credentials. Within api_version 1 changes are additive only.",
